<title>JAPAN: Fuji Bank says its bad loan write-offs have peaked.</title>
<headline>Fuji Bank says its bad loan write-offs have peaked.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fuji Bank Ltd said on Friday that its bad loan write-offs had now peaked.</p>
<p>The bank said earlier that it had bad loans of 296.7 billion yen at the end of September this year.</p>
</text>
